      "reason": "The identity trace treats the central counterpart's missing visible aperture and changed rectangular outline as decisive evidence of lost DVD identity. The images support positional correspondence and a round white counterpart, but DVD recognition must weigh disc shape, physical detail and scene context together. Revise only the identity condition; the existing color condition already explicitly tracks the central target and excludes the separate right-hand disc.",
